     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> STARTER: Getting started with the digital tool store </h1>",
      "body": "",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c4396",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p>The STARTER package of the tried-and-tested TMS Tool Management Solutions offers you the most important functions to quickly benefit from the advantages of digital tool management. Thanks to the modular structure of TMS Tool Management Solutions, you can expand your tool management at any time with the Bronze, Silver and Gold packages.</p><ul><li>Access to all tool data</li><li>Retrieve the storage location of tools and components</li><li>Manage setup sheets</li></ul><p>Start now for more efficiency in the tool store.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "textmedia",
      "id": "c4395",
      "bg": "",
