  },
  {
   "type": "tiles",
   "header": "<h3> Software modules STARTER package </h3>",
   "cols": 4,
   "tiles": [
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/f/csm_lagerplaetze_2a89227d89.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 645
     },
     "label": "Storage location management Complete tools, tool components and accessories always in view",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4>Storage location management</h4> <p>With the storage location management module, you always have an overview of your complete tools, tool components and accessories. The storage location management contains a virtual 3D kit with which you can quickly and easily map your warehouse in three dimensions and assign the items to a virtual storage location. Each item created can be managed in terms of stock, giving you a quick overview of the storage location, circulation and current stock. External storage and lift systems can of course be addressed via interfaces.</p> <p><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul><li>Quick warehouse overview</li><li>Time saving due to elimination of search and shorter distances</li><li>24-hour tool availability</li><li>Reduction in tool costs</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/5/csm_einzelkomponenten_156d7d1aa0.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 645
     },
     "label": "Individual component management Module for creating your individual components",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4>Individual component management</h4> <p>The software module for the detailed creation of individual components creates a future-proof IoT basis for tool management.</p> <p><strong>System detailed data:</strong></p><ul><li>DIN 4000/4003/ISO 13399 Parameterization</li><li>Technology data (cutting values)</li><li>Graphical component representation</li><li>2D and 3D generation in accordance with DIN 4000 and ISO 13399</li><li>Import of 2D formats DXF/DWG/BMP/TIF/JPG/GIF/PNG</li><li>Import of 3D formats STEP/STL</li><li>Detailed data (e.g. cutting material)</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "logo": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/c/csm_Verwaltung_von_Einrichteblaettern_5c9fce0b99.webp",
      "alt": "",
      "w": 1000,
      "h": 645
     },
     "label": "Management of setup sheets Manage and forward set-up sheets easily",
     "img": null,
     "text": "<h4>Management of setup sheets</h4> <p>Setup sheets provide the user with a list of information and resources required for a job. These can be forwarded directly to the warehouse, to the CAD/CAM station or to the machine and used.</p>"
    }
   ],
